@startuml 04-class-customer-service
title customer-service - Diagrama de clases (hexagonal)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty members

' Nucleo: RxJava 3 | Infraestructura: Reactor (conversion en los adaptadores)

package "domain" <<Rectangle>> {
  class Customer {
    -id : UUID
    -customerType : CustomerType
    -documentType : DocumentType
    -documentNumber : String
    -name : String
    -email : String
    -phone : String
    -address : String
    -status : CustomerStatus
    -createdAt : Instant
    +deactivate()
    +isActive() : boolean
  }
  enum CustomerType {
    PERSONAL
    BUSINESS
  }
  enum DocumentType {
    DNI
    CEX
    PASSPORT
    RUC
  }
  enum CustomerStatus {
    ACTIVE
    INACTIVE
  }
  class DuplicateResourceException
  class ResourceNotFoundException
}

package "application.port.in" <<Rectangle>> {
  interface CreateCustomerUseCase {
    +create(CreateCustomerCommand) : Single<Customer>
  }
  interface GetCustomersUseCase {
    +findAll(CustomerFilter, PageQuery) : Flowable<Customer>
    +findById(UUID) : Single<Customer>
  }
  interface UpdateCustomerUseCase {
    +update(UUID, UpdateCustomerCommand) : Single<Customer>
  }
  interface DeleteCustomerUseCase {
    +delete(UUID) : Completable
  }
  class CreateCustomerCommand <<record>>
  class UpdateCustomerCommand <<record>> {
    documentType, documentNumber, name,
    email, phone, address
    (customerType is immutable)
  }
  class CustomerFilter <<record>>
  class PageQuery <<record>> {
    page : int
    size : int
  }
}

package "application.port.out" <<Rectangle>> {
  interface CustomerRepositoryPort {
    +save(Customer) : Single<Customer>
    +findById(UUID) : Maybe<Customer>
    +findAll(CustomerFilter, PageQuery) : Flowable<Customer>
    +existsByDocument(DocumentType, String) : Single<Boolean>
  }
}

package "application.service" <<Rectangle>> {
  class CustomerCommandService
  class CustomerQueryService
}

package "infrastructure.adapter.in" <<Rectangle>> {
  class CustomerController <<inbound adapter>>
  class CustomerRestMapper
  class GlobalExceptionHandler {
    mapea errores a RFC 7807
  }
}

package "infrastructure.adapter.out" <<Rectangle>> {
  class R2dbcCustomerRepositoryAdapter <<outbound adapter>>
  interface CustomerR2dbcRepository <<Spring Data R2DBC>>
  class CustomerEntity
}

CreateCustomerUseCase <|.. CustomerCommandService
UpdateCustomerUseCase <|.. CustomerCommandService
DeleteCustomerUseCase <|.. CustomerCommandService
GetCustomersUseCase <|.. CustomerQueryService
CustomerCommandService ..> CustomerRepositoryPort
CustomerQueryService ..> CustomerRepositoryPort
CustomerCommandService ..> DuplicateResourceException
CustomerQueryService ..> ResourceNotFoundException

CustomerRepositoryPort <|.. R2dbcCustomerRepositoryAdapter
R2dbcCustomerRepositoryAdapter ..> CustomerR2dbcRepository
R2dbcCustomerRepositoryAdapter ..> CustomerEntity

CustomerController ..> CreateCustomerUseCase
CustomerController ..> GetCustomersUseCase
CustomerController ..> UpdateCustomerUseCase
CustomerController ..> DeleteCustomerUseCase
CustomerController ..> CustomerRestMapper

Customer --> CustomerType
Customer --> DocumentType
Customer --> CustomerStatus

note bottom of CustomerCommandService
  DELETE es una baja logica (deactivate):
  evita productos huerfanos en account-service
  y credit-service.
end note

note bottom of CustomerRepositoryPort
  La base de datos mantiene una restriccion unica
  sobre documentType + documentNumber. Si dos altas
  concurrentes colisionan, el adaptador traduce el
  conflicto a DuplicateResourceException (HTTP 409).
end note

@enduml
